    {
      "id": "claim_ff5540c9dcf54d78959182fda4d52e17",
      "statement": "The infrastructure directory contains three independent deployment layers: local Docker Compose services (PostgreSQL, SearxNG, Open WebUI), a reusable Helm chart (kubernetes-job) for batch Job deployments with PVC storage, and Terraform with four roots (main for the Linode LKE cluster, openrouter for the OpenRouter workspace, guardrail, key and preset, github for repository settings, the main ruleset and Actions variables and secrets, linode for Object Storage buckets holding Terraform state and the shared Nx cache).",
