      "id": "claim_833d4cc25c0e422eaeecc93426e24646",
      "statement": "Three local services are managed via Nx targets: postgres (up/down/recreate), searxng (up/down/open), and open-webui (up/down/open), all using docker-compose.yml at infrastructure/docker/docker-compose.yml.",
