      "id": "claim_a216c323e88142a59e3d12fd67f55bc2",
      "statement": "Terraform at infrastructure/terraform/ provisions a Linode LKE cluster (linode_lke_cluster, label lexico-prod, a g6-standard-1 node pool with count 1 and autoscaler min 1/max 3) and outputs a sensitive kubeconfig. Additional roots manage OpenRouter (workspace, guardrail, key assignment, ranked-model preset written with a management key), GitHub (repository settings, main ruleset, Actions variables and secrets sourced from other roots), and Linode Object Storage (state buckets, and an Nx cache bucket with read-only and read-write keys).",
